<title>CANADA: UGG details Canada oats supply and dispositions.</title>
<headline>UGG details Canada oats supply and dispositions.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Grain Growers Ltd on Wednesday issued its supply and disposition estimates for oats in the 1996/97 (Aug/July) crop year.</p>
<p>SUPPLY     96/97 Est.  95/96 Est.  5-yr-avg ('000 tonnes)</p>
<p>open stocks  415	   740	   765</p>
<p>output     4,637	 2,858	 2,934</p>
<p>total:     5,056	 3,603	 3,701</p>
<p>USE</p>
<p>exports    1,250	 1,132	   931</p>
<p>seed	   150	   171	   147</p>
<p>human food   250	   266	   194</p>
<p>feed/waste 2,100	 1,619	 1,770</p>
<p>total:     3,750	 3,188	 3,043</p>
<p>CARRYOVER  1,306	   415	   659</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
